  "note": "Election of the Enniskillen Urban Council, ordinary day 15 May 1939; only the requisite number were nominated, so there were no contests and the new Council was returned unopposed (Fermanagh Herald, 20 May 1939, p. 5, 'Unopposed returns for Enniskillen Council'). Returned unopposed. Ferguson and Winslow were new members. Returned unopposed."
